'''The Notch''' was a narrow opening of [[Beggar's Canyon]] on [[Tatooine]].<ref name="SWCL" />

{{Nature-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
{{Quote|Fitting these Pods through The Notch is like fitting Jabba into an X-34 Landspeeder! It's gonna be tight!|[[Fodesinbeed Annodue|Fode]] in ''LEGO Star Wars: The Skywalker Saga''|<ref name="LEGO">''[[LEGO Star Wars: The Skywalker Saga]]''</ref>}}
In the [[2022]] non-[[canon]] [[Star Wars video games|video game]] ''[[LEGO Star Wars: The Skywalker Saga]]'', the Notch appears as part of the mission "The Boonta Eve Classic" during which the [[Troig]] announcer [[Fodesinbeed Annodue]] compares the tightness of [[podracer]]s making it through the Notch to fitting the [[Hutt]] [[Jabba Desilijic Tiure]] into a [[X-34 landspeeder]].<ref name="LEGO" />

